--- !u!114 &1023499359
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1023499357}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Welcome to Cafe Meiboa! This might all feel very familiar compared to
    a certain other game out there called Cups and Cats. But rest assured, this will
    hopefully feel like a fresh new take on the game, and there are actually a couple
    changes to be aware of:


    1. The phone doesn''t exist, so milk, mechanic,
    and thief mechanics are reworked

    2. A lot of the late game mechanics don''t
    exist, like foreign coffee. I could only do so much ;-;

    3. Many of the machine
    steps are either simplified or don''t exist, for example Matcha (which straight
    up replaces Green tea)



    Most notably, the main objective of the original
    game - to buy the shop - is not the goal anymore (and would''ve taken forever).
    Instead, choose between 2 modes:



    1. Casual mode: Beat 3 shift days to
    win! Each day will feature increasingly complex mechanics. Though a veteran player
    would still surely find it easy

    2. Endless mode: Survive for as many days
    as you can! Money can be spent to improve the cafe between each day, and this
    will be much needed because the job will get harder and harder to deal with as
    you go...



    Hope you have funs <3'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 45f6b2a4870a24d49b0af0ecca7b44f7, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -829845234136887535, guid: 45f6b2a4870a24d49b0af0ecca7b44f7, type: 2}
